    <DataNode elementId="AT1G18590-MONOMER" textLabel="Cytosolic sulfotransferase 17" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="AT1G18590-MONOMER" dataSource="plantcyc" />
      <Graphics centerX="600" centerY="395" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">Three sulfotransferases have been identified to specifically catalyze the sulfo transferring reaction involved in glucosinolate biosynthesis. Substrate specificity varies among the three genes in the same ecotype (C24) and between ecotypes (C24 versus Col). AtSOT16 (C24) has broad substrate specificities. Tryptophan and phenylalanine-derived desulfoglucosinolates (desulfoGS) are the best substrates. Also accepts methionine-derived desulfoGS of chain length C3, C4, C5, C6, C7 and C8, although at much lower activities. AtSOT17 (C24) has narrow substrate specificities. Does not act upon tryptophan-derived desulfoGS. Phenylalanine-derived benzyldesulfoglucosinolate is the best substrate. Also accepts methionine derived desulfoGS but has a strong preference for longer side chains, C6, C7 and C8. AtSOT18 (C24) also has narrow substrate specificities. Does not act upon tryptophan-derived desulfoGS. Accepts phenylalanine-derived desulfoGS. Also accepts methionine derived desulfoGS but has a strong preference of longer side chains, C6, C7 and C8. AtSOT18 (Col) has broad substrate specificities with trytophan, phenylalanine and methionine-derived desulfoGS. Here the enzyme data of ATSOT17 came from the C24 ecotype.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="AT1G18590-MONOMER" />
      <Property key="Synonym_1" value="AtSOT17" />
      <Property key="Synonym_2" value="Desulfoglucosinolate sulfotransferase C" />
      <Property key="Synonym_3" value="AtST5c" />
      <Property key="Catalyzes" value="RXN-33139, RXN-33138, RXN-12505, RXN-12504, RXN-12503, RXN-12502, RXN-12501, RXN-12500, RXN-6273" />
      <Property key="CatalyzesCount" value="9" />
      <Property key="GOTerms" value="GO:0005737" />
      <Property key="Accession1" value="AT1G18590.1" />
      <Property key="Gene" value="AT1G18590" />
      <Property key="^citations" value="16367753" />
      <Property key="InstanceNameTemplate" value="MONOMER-*" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_15358770" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_16367753" />
      <CitationRef elementRef="citation_PUB_19077143" />
    </DataNode>
